window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Twisted Together</i></b><b> is the eighth book of W.J. May's best-selling series, The Chronicles of Kerrigan. </b></p> <p>Rae Kerrigan has been branded a traitor. </p> <p>Arrested with no idea why, Rae suddenly finds herself on the wrong side of the Privy Council and possibly for good. She's branded a traitor, just like her father. </p> <p>Forced to trust in someone she doesn't know, she finds herself more confused than ever. Gabriel is cocky, brash, distractingly handsome, and apparently working for the Privy Council under Carter. </p> <p>Forced to prove her innocence, Rae will stop at nothing and risk everything.</p>"; 
